{"words": [{"text": "وَكَيْفَ", "translation": "And how (could)"}, {"text": "تَكْفُرُونَ", "translation": "you disbelieve"}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "translation": "while [you]"}, {"text": "تُتْلَىٰ", "translation": "is recited"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translation": "upon you"}, {"text": "ءَايَـٰتُ", "translation": "(the) Verses"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَفِيكُمْ", "translation": "and among you"}, {"text": "رَسُولُهُۥ ۗ", "translation": "(is) His Messenger"}, {"text": "وَمَن", "translation": "And whoever"}, {"text": "يَعْتَصِم", "translation": "holds firmly"}, {"text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translation": "to Allah"}, {"text": "فَقَدْ", "translation": "then surely"}, {"text": "هُدِىَ", "translation": "he is guided"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "صِرَٰطٍۢ", "translation": "a path"}, {"text": "مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ", "translation": "straight"}], "sahih": "And how could you disbelieve while to you are being recited the verses of Allāh and among you is His Messenger? And whoever holds firmly to Allāh1 has [indeed] been guided to a straight path."}